# UNERA V2 — Selection check (single-select rows)

**Scope:** Any **single-select row** under `NewUnera/` where the user picks one option from a list — transfer type, saved bank account, payment method, bank picker modal row, etc.

**Canonical reference:** [`NewUnera/send-enhanced.html`](../NewUnera/send-enhanced.html) — Step 2 `.send-option` rows (~L2210–2251), CSS (~L775–789, ~L1468–1476), `syncSendOptionCheckmarks()` (~L2848+).

**Related:** [`.cursor/rules/newunera-checkmark-icon.mdc`](newunera-checkmark-icon.mdc) (`UNERA_CHECKMARK_SVG`), [`.cursor/rules/newunera-color-system.mdc`](newunera-color-system.mdc) §7 (fin-up selection).

---

## Markup contract

Trailing indicator on the **right** of the selectable row:

```html
<div class="method-check send-option-check" aria-hidden="true"></div>
```

| Rule | Detail |
|------|--------|
| Classes | **Both** `method-check` and `send-option-check` — do not use bare `.method-check` alone |
| ARIA | `aria-hidden="true"` on the check div; selection state lives on the row (`aria-checked` / `aria-selected`) |
| Parent row | `.send-option`, `.saved-method-card`, or equivalent selectable card with `.selected` when active |
| SVG | **Empty in HTML** — inject via JS when selected (see below) |

**Do not:**

- ❌ CSS-only filled circle without the stroked `unera-checkmark` when selected
- ❌ Inline legacy polyline SVG baked into static HTML
- ❌ Unicode `✓` or filled Material check in the indicator well
- ❌ Bare `.method-check` without `send-option-check`

---

## Required CSS

```css
.method-check {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 2px solid var(--neutral-300);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
}
.send-option-check {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 0.125rem; /* optional on vertically centered rows — harmless */
}
.send-option.selected .send-option-check,
.saved-method-card.selected .send-option-check {
    background: var(--fin-up);
    border-color: var(--fin-up);
    color: var(--brand-white);
}
.send-option.selected .send-option-check .unera-checkmark,
.saved-method-card.selected .send-option-check .unera-checkmark {
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
}
```

Extend the `.selected .send-option-check` selector list when adding new row types (e.g. `.bank-picker-card.selected .send-option-check`).

---

## JS behavior (required)

Define once per page (or shared script):

```js
const UNERA_CHECKMARK_SVG = '<svg class="unera-checkmark" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>';

function syncSendOptionCheckmarks(scope) {
    var root = scope || document;
    root.querySelectorAll('.send-option-check').forEach(function (checkEl) {
        var item = checkEl.closest('.send-option, .saved-method-card');
        if (!item) return;
        checkEl.innerHTML = item.classList.contains('selected') ? UNERA_CHECKMARK_SVG : '';
    });
}
```

Call **`syncSendOptionCheckmarks()`** after every selection change and after dynamic row render. On reset, clear `.selected` from rows then sync.

Add new row types to the `closest(...)` list when they use this indicator.

---

## Where this applies

| Surface | Row class | Reference |
|---------|-----------|-----------|
| Send transfer type | `.send-option` | `send-enhanced.html` step 2 |
| Send saved bank | `.saved-method-card` | `send-enhanced.html` step 3 (bank branch) |
| Add Money payment methods | `.saved-method-card` | `add-money.html` — migrate from legacy inline SVG |
| Get UNERA CAD fiat methods | `.saved-method-card` | `get-unera-cad.html` — migrate |
| Redeem bank picker | `.saved-method-card` / `.bank-picker-card` | `redeem-unera-cad.html` — migrate |

**Not this pattern:** stepper circles (`.step-circle`), processing chips (`.proc-icon.done`), success hero — use [newunera-checkmark-icon.mdc](newunera-checkmark-icon.mdc) sizing for those contexts.

