## Verification

- [ ] Unselected row: empty 20×20 circle, neutral border
- [ ] Selected row: `--fin-up` fill + white stroked check (12×12 inside well)
- [ ] Keyboard / SR: row exposes selection; check div is `aria-hidden="true"`
- [ ] No hardcoded hex — tokens only
